  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Opening Comments (Spike Eskin)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Chat**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Strange Boat**: rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Nothing To Find**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Chat & Tuning**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Chat**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Blankets**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Play It All Night Long**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **twod2022-12-20.SchoepsMK41.24bit** (recommended): source not stated; 29 songs; 152 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Guests Matt Lowell and Craig Finn joined Adam Granduciel for vocals and maracas [1]\n- Mics clamped to balcony rail, dead center, with Anthony LaMarca on acoustic guitar [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **twod2022-12-20.SchoepsMK41.24bit**: taped by Joe Burns; transferred by Dennis Orr; source: Schoeps MK41's > BabyNbox > Roland R07 @ 24 bit/48 kHz [1]",
